event: final
data: {"type":"final","sequence":0,"request_id":"f0ca8bb4-1098-415e-95e7-40050469695b","status":true,"message":"Chat turn processed successfully.","timestamp":"2026-08-14T08:32:33.775152+00:00","data":{"ai_message":"### Survey ready\nThe survey draft **“Is Fortnite Winning India’s Gamers?”** is ready with **22 respondent-facing questions**. It follows the approved zero-stimulus tracking design and is structured for consistent measurement across future waves.\n\n### Research strategy\nThis is a **brand health tracker** for Epic Games and Fortnite among Indian mobile gamers, combining brand equity, competitive benchmarking, usage, engagement, loyalty, advocacy, switching, social play, and monetisation measures. Wave-level results will help the business understand where Fortnite is gaining or losing salience, usage, preference, loyalty, advocacy, and competitive share—and guide acquisition, retention, win-back, and growth priorities.\n\n### Survey structure\nRespondents move through the mandated brand-equity funnel: **unaided recall**, followed by aided awareness and non-aware termination; **familiarity and usage**; **perception and equity**; **emotional connection**; and finally **loyalty and advocacy**. The questionnaire is organised across Salience, Familiarity & Usage, Perception Equity, Emotional Connection, and Loyalty & Advocacy while keeping core wording, brand lists, scales, and KPI definitions stable for tracking.\n\n### Routing & logic\nSmart branching and screening logic are built in: **1 routing rule** handles the required branching and screening gates, and **1 dynamic carry-forward filter** helps tailor follow-up responses based on earlier answers.\n\n### Review invitation\nPlease review the draft and let me know if you would like any wording, response options, brand lists, KPI treatment, or routing logic refined before launch.","chat_id":"03a74ac5-bd15-459c-b9fe-f6417495eae6","guest_id":null,"chat_turn_id":"1aa18e62-d2d4-4ccb-9423-da936ee8a5e9","chat_nam